<title>HUNGARY: Hungary one-month bill yield rises to 22.12 pct.</title>
<headline>Hungary one-month bill yield rises to 22.12 pct.</headline>
<dateline>BUDAPEST 1996-12-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>The average annual yield on the latest issue of one-month discount treasury bills was set by auction at 22.12 percent, up from 21.46 percent at an auction one week ago, the Government Debt Management Agency said.</p>
<p>Full details of the auction follow.</p>
<p>    Total on offer	     1,000 million forints</p>
<p>    Total bids received	  879.07 million forints</p>
<p>    Total allocated		879.07 million forints</p>
<p>    Total issued		 1,000.00 million forints</p>
<p>    Average annual yield	    22.12 pct</p>
<p>    Average price		     98.4488 pct</p>
</text>
